<div class="section-no">04 — Recursive Self-Improvement</div>
<h2>The Intelligence Explosion: Four RSI Loops</h2>
<p>
  Recursive self-improvement (RSI) is the most uncertain and potentially most consequential pathway. The report maps it to four distinct loops, each with a human evolutionary analogy — and each already seeing early concrete examples.
</p>

